      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=INPUT DATA:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.data) }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an expert data extraction and business intelligence assistant. Analyze the consolidated JSON array containing LinkedIn profile titles and links provided in the input.\n\nThe current target search query is: \"{{ $('Limit').itemMatching(0).json.keywords }}\"\n\nYour tasks are:\n\nExtract the key professional information for EACH individual profile object found in the input array.\n\nMaintain and pass through the original \"link\" value for each profile without any modifications.\n\nEvaluate the relevance of each profile against the search target/intent: \"{{ $('Limit').itemMatching(0).json.keywords }}\". Assign an integer \"score\" from 1 to 5 based on this scale:\n\n5: Perfect match (The profile explicitly holds a role/title and works in an industry or company type that perfectly matches the search query: \"{{ $('Limit').itemMatching(0).json.keywords }}\").\n\n4: Strong match (Holds a high-level leadership or director role in a closely related field or industry aligned with the query).\n\n3: Partial match (Matches either the role or the industry/keyword but not both perfectly, or has a generic title with unclear industry relevance).\n\n2: Low match (Mid-level role or marginally related title to the search query: \"{{ $('Limit').itemMatching(0).json.keywords }}\").\n\n1: Completely irrelevant, non-matching, or missing critical data.\n\nCRITICAL: Do NOT include any reasoning, explanation, or justification for the score. Return only the raw data.\n\nYou must strictly return a clean JSON Array of objects. Do not include any markdown formatting, do not wrap the response in ```json\n\nJSON Structure required:\n[\n  {\n    \"first_name\": \"Extract only the person's first name\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Extract only the person's last name/surname\",\n    \"role\": \"Extract their title, such as CEO, Founder, Co-founder, etc.\",\n    \"company\": \"Extract the name of the company\",\n    \"score\": 5,\n    \"link\": \"Pass through the exact URL link provided in the input object\"\n  }\n]\n"
        }
      },
